# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH: Path to a Firebase service account JSON key.
# Powers the admin "Subscribers" panel (list/disable/delete customer accounts) — this
# requires the Firebase Admin SDK, which needs real server-side credentials.
# Get one from: Firebase Console -> Project Settings -> Service Accounts -> Generate new
# private key. Never commit the downloaded file (it's already gitignored as
# service-account*.json). If unset, the app looks for ./service-account.json by default,
# and the Subscribers panel simply stays unavailable until a key is provided.
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH="./service-account.json"
